  "description": "Adds the FHIR-to-v2 direction of ConceptMap/table-hl70200-to-name-use of hl7.fhir.uv.v2mappings 1.0.0, which maps v2 to FHIR only. Reversed, that map gives official two sources (L and R) and temp two (NAV and TEMP); this map names L (Official Registry Name) for official, since R is the registered name of an animal, and TEMP (Temporary Name) for temp, since NAV states a name temporarily unavailable, and each other code its one source. Used by the PID inverse of FerroBRIDGE #1716.",
